# Act on the open items of #general thread 1700000000.000100, asked for by you.

Work through the open items of this Slack thread (#general thread 1700000000.000100) listed
below. For each one, decide whether it is done, needs a reply, or needs the
user: resolve what the facts settle, propose the replies or nudges it needs,
and ask the user only what you cannot decide. The replies and nudges you
propose as drafts wait in the Outbox for the user's approval; a tool that acts at
once, such as `slack_send_message`, posts as the user without it, so use one only
when the user asked you to.

